# Accepted findings with justification. Reviewed 2026-08-24. Nothing here
# silences an unmitigated exploitable issue in the demo scope.

# EKS public API endpoint: deliberate, documented DEMO trade-off so the
# assignment can be operated without a bastion/VPN. Production design uses a
# private endpoint (docs/aws-production-design.md, docs/tradeoffs.md).
# 0040 = public access enabled, 0041 = public access CIDR 0.0.0.0/0.
AVD-AWS-0040
AVD-AWS-0041

# Unrestricted node-group egress security group rule: terraform-aws-modules/eks
# default; worker nodes need outbound access (ECR pulls, AWS APIs) through the
# NAT gateway. Production hardening: VPC endpoints + scoped egress
# (docs/aws-production-design.md).
AVD-AWS-0104
